    "description": {
      "value": "This hat comes in many forms, such as a colorful turban or a pointy hat with a brim, and can bear symbols or runes. It grants you a +1 item bonus to Arcana checks and allows you to cast the prestidigitation cantrip as an arcane innate spell.\n\nThis larger, fancier hat grants a +2 bonus and can be activated.\n\n**Activate** 3A Cast a Spell; **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast a 4th-level arcane summon elemental spell."
